  ------------------------
    WAVEFUNCTION SUMMARY
  ------------------------

  MO formalism                            : Unrestricted
  Calculation type                        : KS-DFT, Kohn-Sham determinant (.fchk method: UKS)
  Number of atoms                         : 2
  Number of basis functions               : 10
  Primitive gaussians                     : 14
  Spin density                            : read from the .fchk
  Alpha / beta electrons                  : 1 / 1
  SCF energy (au)                         :      -1.1734967936

